codex
The paper is correctly rejected; no generator is shipped.

The native Track B construction passed G1–G8, but failed mandatory G9(b) after the one permitted escalation:

- Bare medium: 0/3 solved.
- Placebo medium: 0/3 solved.
- Structurally hinted medium: Grok returned a witness that verified exactly.
- Track A is invalid because an \(O(n^2)\) scan solves every generated instance: 8,256 operations versus a 120-operation compact route.

A parser bug exposed during hardening was fixed, and the hinted evaluation was rerun before making this decision. See the [paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/2110.12933).

